--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 95847929271290341bb73bbda3eeeffc, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldWomen_Greeting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogueId: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Maria
    text: "Oh, hello there, dear! Come closer, don't be shy. You look like you\u2019ve
      traveled a very long way... and those clothes, they certainly aren't from around
      here, are they?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Maria
    text: Don't you worry, you're safe here. Our little village always has room for
      a weary soul. What brings a young lad like you to such a quiet corner of the
      world?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Thank you. To be honest, I'm looking for something... a large, glowing
      golden key. Have you seen anything like that nearby?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Maria
    text: A golden key? Oh, my sweet child, I'm afraid the only things glowing around
      here are the fireflies by the lake. A key like that sounds like something out
      of a bedtime story.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Maria
    text: "But wait... if there\u2019s anyone who remembers stories of strange things,
      it would be Old George."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Old George? Where can I find him?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Maria
    text: "He\u2019s usually at the Village Market. Just follow this main path straight
      ahead, you can't miss it. Don't be startled by the smell of ale or his sharp
      tongue that's just his way of saying hello."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Maria
    text: Tell him Maria sent you, perhaps he'll be a bit more polite. Take care
      of yourself, you hear?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98995e056fccfdc44858f6a0e27433e2, type: 3}
  endActions: []
